config-connector-extensions patch 0045: mockgcp serves IAM v3 access policies.

For iam.gcp.hfl.dev IAMAccessPolicy. Written here:
mockiam/accesspolicies.go registers the AccessPolicies gRPC server and, as
patches 0030 and 0044 do (mockgcp has no generated HTTP gateway for
google.iam.v3), adds the REST paths
(/v3/{organizations,folders,projects}/*/locations/*/accessPolicies) to the
mux by hand, calling the server's methods. Create, get, list, update (the
whole policy: the API's update has no mask) and delete; create, update and
delete answer a finished operation. A rule needs an effect, principals and
permissions. A policy a binding names cannot be deleted without force. The
etag is computed; an update with a stale etag is refused. Not served:
searchPolicyBindings, validateOnly. Needs cloud.google.com/go/iam v1.14.0
(apiv3 has access policies from then). Upstream candidate: yes.
Numbered: it edits mockiam/service.go after 0006, 0007, 0010, 0030 and 0044.

diff --git a/mockgcp/mockiam/service.go b/mockgcp/mockiam/service.go
